---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Submissions and letters
description: Every submission and letter Ipswich BUG has sent to council, TMR and government, with their responses.
permalink: /submissions/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="wrap prose prose-wide">
  <h1>Submissions and letters</h1>
  <p class="lead">What we've put to council, TMR and government, and what came back. Letters are published so the record is public and nothing gets quietly forgotten.</p>
  {% if submissions.length %}
  <table class="submissions">
    <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>To</th><th>Subject</th><th>Documents</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in submissions | sort(true, false, "date") %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ s.date | readableDate("d LLL yyyy") }}</td>
        <td>{{ s.to }}</td>
        <td><strong>{{ s.title }}</strong>{% if s.summary %}<br><span class="small">{{ s.summary }}</span>{% endif %}{% if s.issue %}<br><a href="{{ s.issue }}">Related issue</a>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if s.doc %}<a href="{{ s.doc }}">Our submission</a>{% endif %}{% if s.response %}<br><a href="{{ s.response }}">Response</a>{% else %}{% if s.doc %}<br><span class="small">No response yet</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% else %}
  <p>Nothing published yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="small">To add a row, edit <code>src/_data/submissions.json</code> and put PDFs in <code>src/assets/docs/</code>.</p>
</div>
